{"4211050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Juggling Cup", "steam_appid": 4211050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This idle game brings a soccer ball to your desktop, ready whenever you want a quick distraction. Work, pause, and kick the ball around for a moment of fun, ideal for a break or even for use in your live streams.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a break, have fun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its main objective is to make the ball bounce and prevent it from falling to the ground or hitting the sides or top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from your studies, from your work, and rest your mind with a relaxing and challenging game for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 20 options, including sports balls and special items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211050/extras/c620fa07ae6fce6e8ae5f82e2525e728.poster.avif?t=1788106795\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211050/extras/c620fa07ae6fce6e8ae5f82e2525e728.webm?t=1788106795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211050/extras/c620fa07ae6fce6e8ae5f82e2525e728.mp4?t=1788106795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We also have special shuttlecocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have 3 different types of shuttlecocks, which one is your favorite?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211050/extras/5534e236a828147b44615f384872939c.poster.avif?t=1788106795\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\